==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Helmut Krabbe]]s (1,400%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s (1,400%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**6 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s (1,400%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Corporal Weyland]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Should you have [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3 [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], this stage is extremely easy. With just Cats of the Cosmos Chapter 2 Treasures, you might need to bring an anti-Alien here.

